WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.409
Step 1. Open Bill Medications.

1.2
00:00:02.409 --> 00:00:07.663
Here you bill the medicines of a patient's prescriptions at the pharmacy.

1.3
00:00:07.663 --> 00:00:11.905
On the Prescription Queue, select Bill Now on a row.

2.1
00:00:11.905 --> 00:00:15.237
Step 2. Check the prescriptions and medicines.

2.2
00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:18.989
Care selects every medicine that is not fully dispensed.

2.3
00:00:18.989 --> 00:00:25.051
When Mark Complete is ticked, Care completes the prescription as it saves the bill.

3.1
00:00:25.051 --> 00:00:31.062
Step 3. Select the lots. Care fills Select Lot from the dosage instructions,

3.2
00:00:31.062 --> 00:00:37.248
taking the lots that expire first. To change the lots, select the lot cell.

4.1
00:00:37.248 --> 00:00:43.639
Step 4. Enter the quantities. Enter the Quantity for each lot as a whole number.

4.2
00:00:43.639 --> 00:00:48.668
When All Given is on, Care marks the medicine as dispensed.

5.1
00:00:48.668 --> 00:00:51.437
Step 7. Bill the selected medicines.

5.2
00:00:51.437 --> 00:00:55.425
Check the Estimated Total, and then select Bill Selected.

5.3
00:00:55.425 --> 00:01:01.453
Care opens the dispense order, and the payment sheet when it issued an invoice.
